{"title":"Mossback","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 48 Mossback that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (0.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mossback\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>537</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>310</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>537</td><td>in the wilds around 2238, 1480</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>310</td><td>in the wilds around 2230, 1481</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 11 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ancient-moss\" title=\"Ancient Moss - in 64% of 11 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 13 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d586c8d80dfb5cdeac77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ancient Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">64% · 7/11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shell-stone\" title=\"Shell Stone - in 55% of 11 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 9 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c64481875084d7ec0d03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shell Stone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">55% · 6/11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"living-moss\" title=\"Living Moss - in 18% of 11 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0a59352953e2cefa4996.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Living Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">18% · 2/11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-silk\" title=\"Spider Silk - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0b2636b90d57ad14912f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 1/11</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-friend-mossback-clutch\" title=\"Spider Friend Mossback Clutch - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/80d997b766f4783a2bf8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Friend Mossback Clutch</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 1/11</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 1/11</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"heartstone\" title=\"Heartstone - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2f686f4db776b0c92b03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Heartstone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 1/11</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-751.0px,-1470.2px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:785.4px;top:1450.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:697.6px;top:1466.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:752.5px;top:1453.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:692.3px;top:1486.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:780.3px;top:1464.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:695.0px;top:1479.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:761.9px;top:1489.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:824.9px;top:1484.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:714.1px;top:1471.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:723.3px;top:1436.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:724.0px;top:1488.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:742.2px;top:1471.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:656.3px;top:1486.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:720.0px;top:1